  "description": {
   "en": "Former archery prodigy Yoo Sanghyun was destined for greatness until an injury forced him to quit. Though his coach helped him secure a stable job, he never felt like he belonged. Frustrated, he leaves it all behind to pursue game streaming. \n\nLeveraging his incredible archery skills and the charm of his noob character, he quickly rises to fame as \"Almond.\" Now, he's determined to dominate the gaming world, but will his virtual success translate into something greater in real life?"
  },
